# Agent Review Workflow {#title}

Issued by {{vars.company}}. Agents address stable nodes such as @[risk-table]
instead of byte offsets. The NODX 1.0 Agent SDK requires `beforeHash` on every
mutating op and validates the document **after every operation**.

::::section {#policy}
## Policy Surface

:::note {#guardrail type="warning" status="pending" fallback="children"}
Approved content requires an explicit policy override before mutation.
:::

